  "description": "PLCcom.Opc.Ua.PubSub is a high-level .NET library for building OPC UA PubSub publisher and subscriber applications. It supports brokerless UDP/UADP (unicast and multicast) and broker-based MQTT transport with both UADP binary and JSON encoding, including MQTT TLS (mqtts://) and mutual TLS (mTLS). The fluent API requires only a few lines of code to publish or subscribe to OPC UA data sets. Runs cross-platform on .NET Framework 4.7.2+, .NET Standard 2.1, .NET 8, .NET 9, .NET 10, and .NET 11. Requires a valid PLCcom.Opc.Ua.PubSub license (free 14-day trial available).",
  "iconFile": "PLCcom_mittel_quadratisch.png",
